                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;font-weight:700;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-weight: 700;\">地狱地铁【低练度全自动】作业&nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\">https://dc.gamekee.com/593808.html</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-weight: 700;\">无米莉亚，一火奶猫，三火彼列，老咸鱼终于凹过了地铁三，记录并分享一下</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\">https://dc.gamekee.com/594016.html</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-weight: 700;\">低配地狱地铁.无光琴·无禁疗，提裙大爹主C，奶猫亲娘保命。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\">https://dc.gamekee.com/593408.html</span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"地铁须知\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">1、<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">请注意：地狱地铁的通关奖励并没有你们想象中那么丰厚，所以各位急眼的，想花钻硬冲的，都可以停一停了。</span>因为地铁通关之后，只会给你装备天然石和融化剂，没有其他实质性的奖励，这两个道具都是需要搭配附魔石一起使用的，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">如果你没有足够的附魔石支撑，那么空有天然石和融化剂是没意义的。</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">（以正常玩家角度来看，不是大力氪金的情况下，后期主要还是缺附魔石，并不会缺天然石和融化剂）</span>，打个不恰当的比方：通关地铁相当于提高花呗额度，但你平时用不到这么多钱，也没有能力还这么多钱，那么提高额度是没有意义的。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">2、<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">地狱地铁并不是必须通关第三个地铁的，只能打过第二个，哪怕第一个难度也是可以的。</span>地铁的通关进度只影响你的天然石＆融化剂的获取速度，但是如果你的消耗速度跟不上获取速度，那么只通关难度2也没区别<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">（正如我上面说的，这个系统主要还是缺附魔石，你附魔石少的情况下根本用不到这么多天然石和融化剂，那你急什么呢？</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">通关进度要和你的附魔石获取速度相匹配！某一边获取太少的话都不行！</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">3、<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">入场时，请选好15个角色再入场，不要只选5个人就进场了！</span>虽然说5个人也能通关，但毕竟不是每个人都能做到，所以能带15个人还是带满15个人比较好，哪怕你用她们送死攒DS条，也是有作用的。</div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"490\" data-height=\"519\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_490/h_519/202/63428/2023/5/23/585878.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_490/h_519/202/63428/2023/5/23/585878.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;\">难绷之5人战地铁</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">🤡</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">🤡</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">🤡</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">🤡</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">🤡</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px;\"></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><br></span></span></div>4、<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">国际服的三倍附魔已经变为永久活动，望周知</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1468\" data-height=\"462\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1468/h_462/202/63428/2023/5/23/984949.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1468/h_462/202/63428/2023/5/23/984949.jpg\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"小技巧合集\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">1、</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">地铁前后关卡的血量是继承的，且每一个关卡可以多次挑战</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">（超时也会继承关卡进度及血量），</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\">总有人打了半天地铁还不知道，还以为每一关只能打5分钟</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">，时间到了没打死就团灭了，事实上你可以打10000次，只要你能造成伤害，磨都能磨死他。</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"422\" data-height=\"489\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_422/h_489/202/63428/2023/5/23/873724.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_422/h_489/202/63428/2023/5/23/873724.png\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">当战斗结束后，血量、状态全部继承，不会刷新</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2、<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">地铁队伍在每天日常刷新的时候会回复一定血量</span>，有时候你的队伍经历完一场战斗，已经全员残血，碰巧下一次战斗开局全员扣8000血，进去就暴毙。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">这时候你可以等几天，每天日常刷新都会给你回血</span>，等血回多一点再去打就可以了。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">3、<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">有一些关卡是推荐你攒满一管DS条再进入战斗的</span>，下局开局可以先放一个DS（狂暴类DS）<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">还有的关卡是需要你提前攒好80%FT条和100%DS条再入场的</span>，这样下局开局就能打FT，让对面开局减员，会好打很多。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"603\" data-height=\"389\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_603/h_389/202/63428/2023/5/23/151882.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_603/h_389/202/63428/2023/5/23/151882.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">攒一个FT再进下一关</span></div><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">4、我们所谓的SL，实际上就是拼运气，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">如果战局没有朝我们想象中的方向发展，发生减员情况，那么我们直接点击战斗正中间的ESCAPE按钮退出即可</span>，不需要直接退游戏，这样也可以把队伍恢复到你没有参战的时候。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"235\" data-height=\"214\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_235/h_214/202/63428/2023/5/23/26282.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_235/h_214/202/63428/2023/5/23/26282.png\"></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"Q＆A合集\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">1.地铁的难度到底多大？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">第三个难度开局你技能条还没转满，对面已经出手把你满血秒掉2-3个了</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">所以，地铁配队必须满足的条件：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">有续航：</span>因为地铁前后关卡是继承血量的，没续航的话，你有可能残血进下一关，战场Buff开局全员掉8000血，进图直接全员暴毙。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">有生命链接：</span>地铁的敌人DS伤害是非常夸张的，敌人盾的DS也可以瞬秒你3个满血单位，所以不要小看任何一个敌人的DS，每个都需要用生命链接来抗伤害。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">伤害量要够：</span>地铁敌人是有大量回血效果的，你队伍输出不够的话，有可能打的没对面回的多。要么就带禁疗人偶。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">控制角色不要带太多：</span>因为敌人的战场Buff经常会出现开局30秒强控免疫，或者时间系Debuff无效，你带的Debuff角色很可能发挥不了效果。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"队伍构成推荐\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">目前测下来，可以给出一个大概的地铁角色梯度表：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">T0级</div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/63428/2022/11/16/9301.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/236746/2023/4/27/306710.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/63428/2023/5/23/926978.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/63428/2023/5/23/926978.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">猫奶，彼列，牡丹地铁三幻神。因为地狱地铁的独特机制，5分钟没打完可以接着打，所以理论上来说，只要你苟命能力够强，可以靠次数堆死敌人。所以队伍的保命能力非常重要。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">猫奶：</span>最强Fullauto队长技能，地铁无法自动的最大难点就是会被敌人抢先手秒杀或控死，而猫奶的队长让我们可以获得稳定的一个保命技能先手，全自动模式下容错率增加是不是一点半点。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(211, 148, 20);\">彼列：</span>最强保命角色，群体2层免疫+不死+生命链接，只要队伍带上彼列直接肉死对面，配合猫奶的先手队长就更不用说了，开局猫奶和彼列的S都打出来，对面基本不可能杀死你了。（加速幅度有保障的情况下，如果你加速太低还是会死，这个在后面加速角色介绍的时候会提到。）</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">牡丹：</span>永远的神，加速加攻免疫回血无敌，就没有牡丹干不了的事情，简单来说，你队伍的伤害、保命、回复、技能频率，全都由牡丹提供，少了牡丹根本就玩不了。SS级人权角色可不是乱评的！</div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">T1级</div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636525913891_95382815.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_248/h_246/202/63428/2022/11/16/18208.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"248\" data-height=\"246\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/236746/2023/4/27/188402.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/57/2022/8/14/913594.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/236746/2023/1/28/927125.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1615708412204_38261682.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 62px;\" data-width=\"127\" data-height=\"124\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/57/2022/4/25/559360.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594189887554_69223127.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"90\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_246/h_250/202/63428/2022/11/16/910058.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"246\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 65px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/57/2022/9/12/585805.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/40405/2023/1/1/945387.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/236746/2023/0/4/655618.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618960079_19554832.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 63px;\"></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\">T1角色则是个人单卡较强，或有体系的强力角色，也是除开保命三幻神以外，我们的主要输出来源。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(211, 148, 20);\">蒙眼：</span>蒙眼的保护系增益爆发让她面对豹女、拉弗斯这类有不死角色的时候非常舒服，3体强控在战局后期或是敌人已经减员的情况下，可以压制敌人出手，一般来说，只要敌人已经减员1-2名，而我方蒙眼还在场，这局已经基本拿下了。蒙眼DS提供的魅惑效果可以限制敌人的各类保命回血效果。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(211, 148, 20);\">米莉亚：</span>米莉亚可以提供低攻加速和光系减益回避率，在保障出手频率的同时还能赋予队伍一些额外肉度，不可多得的优质单卡</div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(211, 148, 20);\">薇薇安：</span>薇薇安可以让我们无视狂暴的负作用，也可以用于对抗某些强控类敌人（每个难度开局第一关的连环控制关卡懂的都懂，带上薇薇安随便乱杀）</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(211, 148, 20);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(211, 148, 20);\">光琴：</span>光琴在地狱地铁里可能没有前面2个光辅助那么好用，但她的优点是DS带狂暴，可以配合蒙眼光琴人偶达到双狂暴DS循环，作战能力同样不俗。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">魅魔：</span>魅魔可以提供回合制的低血加速效果，常用于代替米莉亚的位置，或是米莉亚阵亡后，可以用魅魔顶上，加速能力同样很强。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">劳菲：</span>劳菲也是老牌保命角色了，生命链接+缓回+达芙妮人偶，回血量极高，美中不足的就是缺少体系保护，很容易暴毙，可能需要多SL几次</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">姬瓦：</span>地铁通用输出角色，搭配禁止治疗人偶效果非常好，克制不死克制回血克制免疫。</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">木糖猫/西瓜/吸血鬼：</span>这三位角色的原理其实和蒙眼差不多，控制+魅惑，限制敌人出手+克制敌人保命类效果，如果搭配萨拉苏，仓鼠，滑轮等木系体系角色，也可以达到不错的效果。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">滑轮/仓鼠/萨拉苏：</span>这三位也是木队体系的重要组成部分，高加速配合萨拉苏狂暴，保命和输出能力都不弱，和蒙眼光队其实非常类似。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">T2级</div></div><br></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/57/2022/4/25/411835.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/57/2022/2/30/553788.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/57/2022/6/6/202598.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1618987625245_13613321.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627459253111_15380637.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1591778543601_272662.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 63px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/57/2022/3/27/961155.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/57/2022/9/12/559403.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640167039347_80114058.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(197, 126, 8);\">光狗/光击剑：</span>这俩属于蹭局势的，有光琴人偶准备走光队的玩家可以考虑带上</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(197, 126, 8);\">花奶：</span>花奶搭配米莉亚光琴等加速角色可以打出不错的效果，出现意外发生减员，还可以用DS复活起来继续战斗</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">提裙：</span>提裙是存FT玩法的专用角色，碰见某几关特别恶心的，可以在前面一关存好FT，下一关提裙进去直接FT乱杀，就随便过了。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">兔女郎：</span>兔女郎是一个被很多人遗忘的角色，其实她的保护能力真的很强，群体反射+忍耐，能克制地铁大部分类型的敌人，配上几个奶和加速，也能变得刀枪不入</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">甜甜圈：</span>甜甜圈的特点是高频率的增益窃取，用于克制铁桶队，把对面的Buff全偷光，S的混乱并没有测试过能否正常生效，有测过的可以说下，敌人会不会自残。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">炸弹人：</span>带炸弹人的前提是你有草莓人偶，可以作为一个输出角色使用，克制物理伤害回避率高的敌人。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">烟鬼：</span>带烟鬼主要也是需要她的狂暴，玩3火阵容可以尝试。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">珀皮塔：</span>珀皮塔比较特殊，需要搭配鲁邦+萨拉苏+女仆猫一起使用，存好DS进入下一关，开局暴击秒杀3个敌人（但国际服萨拉苏没有攻击力加成，有可能行不通）</div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">T3级</div></div><br></span></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1605171370794_74471673.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1622617495455_1966492.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/236746/2022/10/9/52911.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_248/h_250/202/63428/2022/11/16/747948.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"248\" data-height=\"250\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/57/2022/6/20/860968.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1612855166919_44189771.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1605171451131_54834836.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">都是次选角色，不过多评价，一般用于补位。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"阵容合集\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"猫奶彼列队（可全自动通关全难度）\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">猫奶彼列队</div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><img data-width=\"698\" data-height=\"888\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_698/h_888/202/63428/2023/5/20/150089.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_698/h_888/202/63428/2023/5/20/150089.png\"><div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">阵容须知</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">攻击力前三：</span>蒙眼，奶猫，牡丹</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">DS顺序：</span>如果有光琴人偶，则可以单蒙眼，如果没有光琴人偶，第二个DS从奶猫、彼列里面选一个。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">此阵容3倍速全自动过<span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">前两个难度</span>没什么问题，有光琴人偶可以全自动通关整个地铁（已经多人验证）如果开局暴毙，则需要SL几次即可。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">装备、魂卡、人偶要求</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">装备方面：</span>只有两个要求：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">打FT的角色，武器2号位附魔词条，必须是增加XX%属性到伤害中</span>，绝不能带攻击增加XX%伤害，为什么别人的FT打出来是4位数，你的就是3位数呢？就是这个附魔带错了！</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">打FT的角色，武器3号位附魔词条，必须是攻击时，回复XX%伤害为HP</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">，否则打FT会出现被反射暴毙的情况</span></span><br><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"655\" data-height=\"93\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_655/h_93/202/63428/2023/5/23/24249.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_655/h_93/202/63428/2023/5/23/24249.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"517\" data-height=\"67\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_517/h_67/202/63428/2023/5/23/313577.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_517/h_67/202/63428/2023/5/23/313577.png\" style=\"height: 85px; width: 655.896px;\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">正确的附魔</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"649\" data-height=\"90\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_649/h_90/202/63428/2023/5/23/487135.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_649/h_90/202/63428/2023/5/23/487135.png\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">错误的附魔</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">魂卡方面：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">由于地铁只能用：通用魂卡、PVE限定魂卡、地铁限定魂卡这三种类型，所以可选的并不多。仅推荐一些通用性比较强的魂卡：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596620063016_37091780.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">表演时刻，永远的神卡，全角色通用<br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640167073531_96726356.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\">放松，也是全角色通用<br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/8/14/863907.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\">希特莉卡，全角色通用</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">另外，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">打FT的角色可以穿HP-攻击力的卡</span>，单纯为了叠面板攻击力，打的速度快一点，如果求稳的话还是选择上面3张卡，不过会慢一些。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">人偶方面：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">只有蒙眼身上的人偶比较重要，</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_122/h_122/202/236746/2023/3/26/868808.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"122\" data-height=\"122\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/464078.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\">二选一</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">其他角色的推荐人偶：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">秋牡丹：<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/409919.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/347776.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/721865.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/533368.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">彼列：<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/504316.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/341256.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/18029.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/719779.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\">（没有就不带）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">米莉亚：<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/18029.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:left;width:64px;height:64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/341256.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:left;width:64px;height:64px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:left;\">（没有就不带）</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:left;\">芙蕾雅：</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_248/h_250/202/63428/2022/9/17/499311.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"248\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/709412.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/462259.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/14/830457.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:left;\">（没有就不带）</span></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">Q＆A</div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">1.米莉亚有替换吗？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">其本身的作用是提供加速＆给光系角色提供减益回避率，如果你想走光队路线，那么米莉亚是无法替换的，<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">如果需要强行替换，只能从加速角度，用魅魔/艾修替换</span>，减益回避率这一块影响还是比较大，队伍肉度下降较多，SL的次数几乎是翻倍。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">2.猫奶有替换吗？</span><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">选择带奶猫，是需要她的队长，开局时奶妈获得50%技能充能，也就是说你的奶妈必定会先手，<span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">利用猫奶的队长带动彼列一起出手，双奶先手保证队伍不会暴毙</span></span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">（地铁的生存压力极大，目前全游戏最大的生存压力就是地狱地铁）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\">如果没有奶猫，或者奶猫没点火，那么你就必须无限SL，一直SL到对面开局没把你秒掉，即可抵消没带奶猫的负作用。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line:underline;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">特别是不会手动的玩家，又不想点火，又不想充钱，又不想手动，又不想花时间SL，那你没奶猫，你还想过地铁？</span>手动能力强的玩家不需要奶猫一样能过。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"></div><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">3.只有这一套阵容吗？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">你觉得可能吗？</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">4.蒙眼没红攻怎么办？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">穿HP-攻击力的魂卡，附魔也叠攻击，把攻击力叠到1.2-1.3万即可</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">如果有光琴人偶则不需要吸血附魔，3号词条直接选择无视防御</div></span></span><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br><br></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_490/h_519/202/63428/2023/5/23/585878.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1468/h_462/20